## Development

```bash
# Install dev dependencies
uv sync --group dev

# Run linter + formatter
uv run ruff check . && uv run ruff format .

# Type-check
uv run mypy src/

# Run tests
uv run pytest tests/
```

### Pre-commit hooks

```bash
uv run pre-commit install
```

